## Build the environment — route strategy

Rebuild a faithful, bootable target using the strategy for this route.

There is NO build material (`AWP`): you have a writeup and a confirmed exploit
but no Dockerfile/compose/deploy. Infer the runtime primarily from the writeup's
concrete clues, corroborate it against the exploit's assumptions, and author a
Dockerfile that realizes it. Cite BOTH sources. The exploit (P) is adapted to
this rebuilt runtime in the exploit stage — keep the runtime faithful.

