## Prove it exploitable — route strategy

With the target frozen, prove it faithfully exploitable: run the exploit
under `solve/` from the player vantage against a fresh clean instance until
it captures the harness-minted flag.

## Adapt the exploit; env inferred from writeup + exploit (AWP)

There is no build material. The environment was inferred from the writeup's
concrete runtime clues, corroborated by the exploit. PORT the confirmed exploit
to the live instance; use the writeup to disambiguate whenever a live
observation is ambiguous.

